---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import caseyField from '@/assets/images/casey-prohaska-field.jpg';
import caseyPortrait from '@/assets/images/casey-prohaska.jpg';
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Casey Prohaska, Founder of Cebra Partners, is a Kansas native with experience leading operations, teams, and business growth across the energy and technology industries."
>
  <section class="page-grid pt-10 lg:pt-14">
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-bold sm:text-[50px] sm:leading-tight lg:col-start-2">About</h1>

    <div class="mt-5 flex gap-4 lg:col-start-1 lg:row-start-2 lg:mt-1 lg:flex-col lg:gap-8">
      <Image
        src={caseyPortrait}
        alt="Portrait of Casey Prohaska"
        widths={[163, 326]}
        sizes="163px"
        class="aspect-square w-[163px] max-w-[calc(50%-0.5rem)] object-cover lg:max-w-none"
        loading="eager"
      />
      <Image
        src={caseyField}
        alt="Casey Prohaska in a hard hat and coveralls at an oilfield processing facility"
        widths={[163, 326]}
        sizes="163px"
        class="aspect-[163/199] w-[163px] max-w-[calc(50%-0.5rem)] object-cover object-[50%_72%] lg:max-w-none"
        loading="eager"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="mt-6 max-w-3xl space-y-[1.45em] text-[15px] leading-[1.45] lg:col-start-2 lg:row-start-2 lg:mt-0">
      <p>
        Casey Prohaska, Founder of Cebra Partners, is a Kansas native who brings experience leading operations, teams,
        and business growth across the energy and technology industries. She is seeking to acquire a business where she
        can take an active role in its day-to-day leadership and build on the owner’s legacy.
      </p>
      <p>
        Casey began her career in the Texas oilfields, living in a remote workforce camp without cell service. Her
        commitment to keeping operations running later led her to sleeping in a truck waiting for a critical part, with
        an oilfield just one day away from shutdown and later, following a 10,000 acre wildfire, she was the first
        person to enter the affected area after clearance from the state fire marshal, leading the team that developed
        and executed the plan to bring the oilfield back into operation. These experiences reflect the work that
        energizes her most: being on the ground, taking responsibility, and working alongside a team to solve problems.
      </p>
      <p>
        Throughout her career, Casey has led a 90-person operations team and held leadership roles focused on customer
        relationships and business growth. She brings respect for frontline expertise, a willingness to learn the
        details, and a hands-on approach to leadership.
      </p>
      <p>
        Casey earned a Master of Business Administration (MBA) from Stanford Graduate School of Business and a
        bachelor’s degree in Chemical Engineering from the University of Kansas.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
